{
  "source": "..\\api\\engines.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "引擎 (Engines)",
      "name": "引擎_(engines)",
      "desc": "<p>engines 模块用于启动, 查询和停止脚本引擎, 并监听全部脚本引擎的生命周期事件.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">engines</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "执行配置",
          "name": "执行配置",
          "desc": "<p><code>execScript</code>, <code>execScriptFile</code> 和 <code>execAutoFile</code> 的 <code>config</code> 参数支持以下属性:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[ workingDirectory = engines.myEngine().cwd() ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 工作目录</li>\n<li><strong>[ path = engines.myEngine().cwd() ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - <code>workingDirectory</code> 的兼容别名</li>\n<li><strong>[ delay = 0 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 首次执行前的延迟, 单位为毫秒</li>\n<li><strong>[ interval = 0 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 重复执行之间的间隔, 单位为毫秒</li>\n<li><strong>[ loopTimes = 1 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 执行次数. <code>0</code> 表示持续执行</li>\n<li><strong>[ arguments = {} ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - 传给新引擎的参数</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>arguments</code> 可在新引擎中通过 <code>engines.myEngine().execArgv</code> 读取.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "执行配置"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] execScript",
          "name": "[m]_execscript",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "execScript(name, script, config?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "execScript",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**name** { [string](dataTypes#string) } - 脚本名称 ",
                      "name": "**name**",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) ",
                      "desc": "脚本名称"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**script** { [string](dataTypes#string) } - JavaScript 源码 ",
                      "name": "**script**",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) ",
                      "desc": "JavaScript 源码"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ config = {} ]** {{ ",
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "textRaw": "workingDirectory?: [string](dataTypes#string); ",
                          "name": "workingDirectory?",
                          "desc": "[string](dataTypes#string);"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "path?: [string](dataTypes#string); ",
                          "name": "path?",
                          "desc": "[string](dataTypes#string);"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "delay?: [number](dataTypes#number); ",
                          "name": "delay?",
                          "desc": "[number](dataTypes#number);"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "interval?: [number](dataTypes#number); ",
                          "name": "interval?",
                          "desc": "[number](dataTypes#number);"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "loopTimes?: [number](dataTypes#number); ",
                          "name": "loopTimes?",
                          "desc": "[number](dataTypes#number);"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "arguments?: [object](dataTypes#object); ",
                          "name": "arguments?",
                          "desc": "[object](dataTypes#object);"
                        }
                      ],
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "config = {} ]** {{"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "}} - 执行配置 ",
                      "name": "}}",
                      "desc": "执行配置"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [ScriptExecution](#scriptexecution) } - 脚本执行对象 ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [ScriptExecution](#scriptexecution) ",
                      "desc": "脚本执行对象"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "name"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "script"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "config?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>在新引擎中执行字符串源码.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let execution = engines.execScript(&#39;worker&#39;, `\n    console.log(engines.myEngine().execArgv.message);\n`, {\n    arguments: { message: &#39;hello&#39; },\n});\nconsole.log(execution.getId());\n</code></pre>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] execScript"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] execScriptFile",
          "name": "[m]_execscriptfile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "execScriptFile(path, config?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "execScriptFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - JavaScript 或 Python 文件路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ config = {} ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <a href=\"#执行配置\">执行配置</a></li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#scriptexecution\">ScriptExecution</a> } - 脚本执行对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在新引擎中执行本地脚本文件. 相对路径按当前脚本运行时路径解析.</p>\n<p>从 AutoJs6 6.8.0 开始, 本地 <code>.py</code> 文件由独立的 Python Runtime 插件执行. 插件不可用或已禁用时, 启动将以失败结束, 且不会回退到 JavaScript 引擎.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">engines.execScriptFile(&#39;./worker.js&#39;, {\n    workingDirectory: files.cwd(),\n    delay: 100,\n    loopTimes: 1,\n});\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "config?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] execScriptFile"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] execAutoFile",
          "name": "[m]_execautofile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "execAutoFile(path, config?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "execAutoFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - JavaScript 文件路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ config = {} ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <a href=\"#执行配置\">执行配置</a></li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#scriptexecution\">ScriptExecution</a> } - 脚本执行对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以自动化脚本模式在新引擎中执行 JavaScript 文件. 此方法保留 JavaScript 和原有自动化脚本语义, 并在执行前确保无障碍服务已启动.</p>\n<p>此方法拒绝 Python 文件, 不会将 <code>.py</code> 文件交给 Python Runtime 插件. 执行 Python 文件时使用 <a href=\"#m-execscriptfile\">execScriptFile</a>.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "config?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] execAutoFile"
        },
