        {
          "textRaw": "引擎事件",
          "name": "引擎事件",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.3</code></strong></p>\n<p>engines 是一个 <a href=\"eventEmitterType\">EventEmitter</a>. 生命周期事件会发送到当时存在的每个 JavaScript 引擎.</p>\n",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "start",
              "name": "start",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"#scriptengine\">ScriptEngine</a> } - 已启动的引擎</li>\n</ul>\n<p>脚本开始执行时触发.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">engines.on(&#39;start&#39;, (engine) =&gt; {\n    console.log(`started: ${engine.getId()}`);\n});\n</code></pre>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "start"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "finish",
              "name": "finish",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"#scriptengine\">ScriptEngine</a> } - 已结束的引擎</li>\n</ul>\n<p>脚本正常结束或异常处理完成时触发. 同一次结束随后还会依次触发兼容事件 <code>exit</code> 和 <code>stop</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "finish"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "exit",
              "name": "exit",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"#scriptengine\">ScriptEngine</a> } - 已结束的引擎</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>finish</code> 的兼容事件.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "exit"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "stop",
              "name": "stop",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"#scriptengine\">ScriptEngine</a> } - 已结束的引擎</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>finish</code> 的兼容事件.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "stop"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "exception",
              "name": "exception",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"#scriptengine\">ScriptEngine</a> } - 发生异常的引擎</li>\n<li><strong>error</strong> { <a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\">java.lang.Throwable</a> } - 异常</li>\n</ul>\n<p>脚本发生未处理异常时触发. 随后还会触发兼容事件 <code>error</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "exception"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "error",
              "name": "error",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"#scriptengine\">ScriptEngine</a> } - 发生异常的引擎</li>\n<li><strong>error</strong> { <a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\">java.lang.Throwable</a> } - 异常</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>exception</code> 的兼容事件.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">ScriptExecution</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "error"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "引擎事件"
        }
      ],
      "type": "module",
      "displayName": "引擎 (Engines)"
    },
